#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_type.rst:5
msgid "Folio conductor type"
msgstr "Folio 导体类型"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_type.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **Type** tab from folio properties PopUP window allows pre-defining the "
"`type of conductor`_ that will be drawn in the folio later. The `conductor "
"properties`_ can also be pre-defined. This action avoid defining "
"individually the conductor type and the common properties for each conductor"
" created in the folio."
msgstr ""
"从 folio 属性 PopUP 窗口中的 **Type** 选项卡允许预先定义在 folio 中绘制的 `型导体 <type of "
"conductor_>`_ 。 `导体属性 <conductor properties_>`_ 也可以预先定义。此动作避免了单个定义导体类型和 "
"folio 中创建的每个导体的共同属性 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_type.rst:14
msgid ""
"For more information about conductor properties, refer to `conductor type`_ "
"section."
msgstr "关于导体属性的更多信息，参见 `导体类型 <conductor type_>`_ 节。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_type.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech folio type properties tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech folio 类型属性标签"

#: ../../source/users/folio/properties/folio_type.rst:23
msgid ""
"For more information about how to display folio properties, refer to "
"`display folio properties`_ section."
msgstr ""
"关于如何显示folio属性的更多信息，请参见 `display folio属性 <display folio properties_>`_ 一节。"
